  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.0 — Adds the first add-on packages: Scrubkit.Email (.eml / MIME) and Scrubkit.OpenDocument (.odt / .ods / .odp), each an IFileExtractor you register via ReadOptions.Extractors. Both reference only Scrubkit.Abstractions, so they add no extra dependencies. The core package is unchanged. Full changelog: https://github.com/jjopensoftworks-blip/Scrubkit/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
